WEBVTT

00:02:58.608 --> 00:03:02.060
It's a way of life, in which market thinking

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:04.781
and market values begin to dominate

00:03:04.781 --> 00:03:08.305
every aspect of life:

00:03:08.305 --> 00:03:13.040
personal relations, family life, health, education,

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:16.339
politics, law, civic life.

00:03:16.339 --> 00:03:21.830
Now, why worry? Why worry about our becoming

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:24.376
market societies?

00:03:24.376 --> 00:03:27.480
For two reasons, I think.

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:32.161
One of them has to do with inequality.